X: 1
T: How Blest the Hearts
T: (also known as How Blest Are Hearts)
C: Words: Christopher Wordsworth, 1865, alt.
C: Music and Setting: 'Holy Matrimony' Henry Williams Baker, 1865. 
C: copyright: public domain.  This score is a part of the Open Hymnal Project, 2026 Revision.
S: Music and Lyrics source: "The Holy Year, with Tunes", 1865 Hymn 113
